# Copy to .env (or export these directly) before running the orchestrator.
# Required for Capa 3 (vision extraction) and Capa 2 (chat agent loop). This
# is the one shared key for the whole deployment - end clients never see or
# configure an API key themselves. Set a monthly spending limit on this key
# at console.anthropic.com/settings/limits so it fails gracefully instead of
# surprise-billing you (see README's "Evitar quedarte sin créditos sin avisar").
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides - sensible defaults are baked into app/config.py.
# AXISCAM_VISION_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# AXISCAM_AGENT_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# AXISCAM_STORAGE_DIR=./data
# AXISCAM_DEFAULT_POSTPROCESSOR=haas_vf_generico
# AXISCAM_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
